{"id":"11abe9c52ceec545","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-development-measure.md","title":"发展状态的多重集测度","display":"df-development-measure — 发展状态的多重集测度","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-development-measure","aliases":["56-df-development-measure"],"display":"df-development-measure — 发展状态的多重集测度","depends_on":["[[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]","[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]","[[56-df-multiset-extension]]"],"source_section":"§4.4 Proposition 4.4.5","source_printed_pages":"103","source_ocr_blocks":[124],"source_statement_status":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr","source_proof_status":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-development-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-development-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-development-measure — 发展状态的多重集测度"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4634b959eefaa45b\" href=\"?note=4634b959eefaa45b\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation\">56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"943afdb3e6462a3a\" href=\"?note=943afdb3e6462a3a\" title=\"56-df-multiset-extension\">56-df-multiset-extension</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.4 Proposition 4.4.5"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"103"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>124</span></div>"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"checked-against-local-djvu-ocr"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"read-and-reconstructed-in-note"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为正交TRS，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in T\">\\(s\\in T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\">\\(U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)\\)</span>；红项及位置见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a68d684938525240\" href=\"?note=a68d684938525240\" title=\"56-df-orthogonal-residual\">56-df-orthogonal-residual</a>。<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4634b959eefaa45b\" href=\"?note=4634b959eefaa45b\" title=\"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation\">56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation</a> 保证源红项集有限且同位置规则唯一。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\operatorname{Pos}(s))\">\\(P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\operatorname{Pos}(s))\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\">\\(p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\preceq\">\\(\\preceq\\)</span> 为位置前缀关系。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal M_f(\\mathbb N)\">\\(\\mathcal M_f(\\mathbb N)\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"943afdb3e6462a3a\" href=\"?note=943afdb3e6462a3a\" title=\"56-df-multiset-extension\">56-df-multiset-extension</a> 的有限支撑计数函数约定；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(k\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\mid u\\in U\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\mid u\\in U\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\nu(s,P,p)\\coloneqq\n\\max\\left(\n\\{0\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\n\\left|\\{q\\in P\\mid p\\preceq q\\land q\\preceq r\\}\\right|\n\\;\\middle|\\;\nr\\in P\\land p\\preceq r\n\\right\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\nu(s,P,p)\\coloneqq\n\\max\\left(\n\\{0\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\n\\left|\\{q\\in P\\mid p\\preceq q\\land q\\preceq r\\}\\right|\n\\;\\middle|\\;\nr\\in P\\land p\\preceq r\n\\right\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(s,U)(k)\\coloneqq\n\\left|\\{p\\in \\operatorname{MarkPos}(U)\\mid\\nu(s,\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U),p)=k\\}\\right|.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(s,U)(k)\\coloneqq\n\\left|\\{p\\in \\operatorname{MarkPos}(U)\\mid\\nu(s,\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U),p)=k\\}\\right|.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(s,U)\\in\\mathcal M_f(\\mathbb N).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(s,U)\\in\\mathcal M_f(\\mathbb N).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 是从位置 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 往下的一条分支可遇到的最多标记数；它在没有后继标记时为0。对标记位置本身，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\\ge1\">\\(\\nu\\ge1\\)</span>。范数按每个标记位置的局部 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span> 收集重数。因为位置集有限，max的集合有限非空、计数有限，范数支撑有限，所以所有公式良定义；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U=\\varnothing\">\\(U=\\varnothing\\)</span> 给零多重集。</p>\n<p>此为 Proposition 4.4.5 的下划线复杂度在显式位置标记上的重建。在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P=\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U)\">\\(P=\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U)\\)</span> 时，所有标记位置都以函数符号为头；给它们下划线后，原书 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 在任一子项上的结构递归值等于该处的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\nu\">\\(\\nu\\)</span>：变量/无标记常元为0，带线常元为1，普通函数取子项最大值，带线函数再加1。一般位置集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 仍可含变量位置，计数定义仍良定义，但不声称此时对应原书带线语法。这里用有限前缀计数统一分支，避免另外引入带线项语法。</p>\n<p>来源：Terese (2003), Proposition 4.4.5，印刷103页；原书测度证明已实际读取，本地公式为与其等价的位置编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-orthogonal-residual","status":"resolved","id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"4634b959eefaa45b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-multiset-extension","status":"resolved","id":"943afdb3e6462a3a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-multiset-extension]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-orthogonal-residual","status":"resolved","id":"a68d684938525240","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R$ 为正交TRS，$s\\in T$，$U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$；红项及位置见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]。[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]] 保证源红项集有限且同位置规则唯一。","embed":false},{"target":"56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation","status":"resolved","id":"4634b959eefaa45b","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$R$ 为正交TRS，$s\\in T$，$U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)$；红项及位置见 [[56-df-orthogonal-residual]]。[[56-thm-orthogonal-residual-preservation]] 保证源红项集有限且同位置规则唯一。","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-multiset-extension","status":"resolved","id":"943afdb3e6462a3a","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal M_f(\\mathbb N)$ 采用 [[56-df-multiset-extension]] 的有限支撑计数函数约定；$k\\in\\mathbb N$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in T","display":false},{"tex":"U\\subseteq\\operatorname{Red}_R(s)","display":false},{"tex":"P\\in\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\operatorname{Pos}(s))","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\operatorname{Pos}(s)","display":false},{"tex":"\\preceq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal M_f(\\mathbb N)","display":false},{"tex":"k\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U)\\coloneqq\\{\\operatorname{pos}(u)\\mid u\\in U\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu(s,P,p)\\coloneqq\n\\max\\left(\n\\{0\\}\\cup\n\\left\\{\n\\left|\\{q\\in P\\mid p\\preceq q\\land q\\preceq r\\}\\right|\n\\;\\middle|\\;\nr\\in P\\land p\\preceq r\n\\right\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(s,U)(k)\\coloneqq\n\\left|\\{p\\in \\operatorname{MarkPos}(U)\\mid\\nu(s,\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U),p)=k\\}\\right|.","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DNorm}_R(s,U)\\in\\mathcal M_f(\\mathbb N).","display":true},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu\\ge1","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"U=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"P=\\operatorname{MarkPos}(U)","display":false},{"tex":"v","display":false},{"tex":"\\nu","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false}],"bytes":2639,"backlinks":[{"id":"6d733f353e873b30","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{DNorm}_R$、$\\nu$ 见 [[56-df-development-measure]]；$>^{\\mathrm{mul}}$ 为自然数严格序 $>$ 的 [[56-df-multiset-extension]] 提升。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-99","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-development-measure.md]]"}],"outgoing":["a68d684938525240","4634b959eefaa45b","943afdb3e6462a3a"]}